<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Manager: My BELOVED generator!\rKeep pumpin’ out electricity!\nGive Kanto a GOOD life! I love you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We gotta beef up security so nothin’\nlike this EVER happen again!\rWe hired a guard. He sleep. Still.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The generator up and runnin’.\nIt’s makin’ extra electricity.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The generator runnin’ again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Since they fixed the generator, the\nManager been in a GOOD mood.\rHe hug it. Every mornin’. It’s weird.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight! We can finally get the\nMagnet Train runnin’ again.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I collect homies.\nYou got a DUGTRIO?\rWanna trade it for my MAGNETON? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yesss! I got me a DUGTRIO!\nGood looks!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? That ain’t DUGTRIO.\nYou tried to finesse me...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You don’t wanna trade? Aww...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, how my old MAGNETON doin’?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Staff Mottos:\r1. Electricity ain’t infinite.\n2. Save it wherever you can.\f3. Look out for each other.\f4. No standin’ around.\f5. Wear shoes with rubber soles.\f6. The Manager is AWESOME.\f(He wrote this list.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0344_R10R0201_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Use electricity wisely\nfor a bright, good life.\f           Kanto Power Plant</language>
	</row>
</body>
